      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight. The competitor posing this risk is NoiseGuard, which offers a lower-cost, tactical noise reduction solution that is easier to deploy but lacks the schema registry awareness and entity graph capabilities that Pioneer needs. The exact milestone at risk is the remediation plan execution involving the backfill and shadow-index run, with key dates including schema verification by 2026-03-22, shadow index run from 2026-03-29 to 2026-04-09, and daily standups from 2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30. Missing these milestones risks procurement extending NoiseGuard usage and reducing Northstar's scope, as NoiseGuard is seen as a cheaper near-term fix [art_e2727db588de, art_ac8afb52f2d3, art_79cf94421871].",
